# This machine's user-level npm config sets script-shell to a broken path
# (C:\Program Files\Java\jdk-17\), which makes npm lifecycle/spawn steps fail with
# `spawn ...jdk-17 ENOENT`. Pin a real shell here so installs/scripts in /job-autofill
# work regardless of the global setting. Safe + portable (cmd.exe exists on every Windows).
script-shell=C:\\Windows\\System32\\cmd.exe
